{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1393552-werewolf-the-apocalypse-earthblood-news-cinematic-trailer-live","id":1393552,"title":"Werewolf: The Apocalypse: Earthblood news (Cinematic Trailer Live)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-01T17:07:51-07:00","id":1393552,"title":"Werewolf: The Apocalypse: Earthblood news (Cinematic Trailer Live)","content":"On today's WORLD OF DARKNESS NEWS by Outstar:<br /> <br /> Starting at 28:00<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/18JS_Retjzs\" data-code=\"18JS_Retjzs\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/18JS_Retjzs/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> * Earthblood will be available on PS4, computers, and Xbox One<br /> * We're getting an official announcement on June 5th from IGN's &quot;Summer of Gaming&quot; [Edit: Delayed twice so far due to protests]<br /> * The Cinematic Trailer will debut on June 8th.<br /> * Bloodlines 2 vs. Earthblood comparison: <a href=\"https://screenrant.com/werewolf-apocalypse-vampire-masquerade-bloodlines-video-games-compared/\" target=\"_blank\">https://screenrant.com/werewolf-apoc...ames-compared/</a><br /> * It's a game about Werewolves vs. Pentex with the latter controlled by Vampires.<br /> <br /> The basic plotline as has been revealed:<br /> <br /> Cahal is a Fianna Ahroun who is living in the Pacific Northwest when he gets in a fight with his sept over something that results in him being banished and declared Ronin. Cahal's son is then killed during a conflict with Endron's logging subsidiary which has started clear-cutting the region around his tribe's caern. Returning, Cahal is on a mission of revenge against the vampires who are in charge of the logging despite having no support from his tribe.<br /> <br /> One thing that has been emphasized is that Cahal is not actually in a good mental headspace and he's lost control of his rage due to being a Ronin for a year. As such, Cahal has to manage his rage meter carefully. If he doesn't then he has the potential to frenzy and go on a killing spree of innocents, allies, and other things. If he goes on too many of these frenzies, he's lost to the Beast of War and gets the Bad Ending. On the other hand, the more you rage, the easier the game is.<br /> <br /> Gameplay will include skill trees, stealth, combat [duh], and being able to use three Garou forms. You will have a Hub World around the Pacific Northwest that includes multiple areas as well as the Penumbra. You will be doing side-quests as well as the main quests for EXP.<br /> <br /> CINEMATIC TRAILER:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/p7MRD5nTTbk\" data-code=\"p7MRD5nTTbk\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/p7MRD5nTTbk/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&a